From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eturlia <eturlia@eturnercus.dev>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 08:08:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: ASIC BLOCK mixin/API bridges

- ItemStack/Item getCraftingRemainingItem for Farmers Delight
- void dropAllDeathLoot for Let's Do Farm & Charm
- ComponentSerialization 1-arg matcher for CreativeCore
- travel isInFluidType(FluidState) for Supplementaries
- spawnAtLocation ItemEntity ctor for quality_food
- Mob.checkDespawn discard()V for letmedespawn
- BlockItem 4-arg getPlaceSound for lodestone
- Boat.Type + DamageEffects + ItemDisplayContext + GrassColorModifier IExtensibleEnum for Twilight Forest

